Something, when to tell somebody about moving.

653
00:55:25,260 --> 00:55:27,260
And how much advance notice do you give.

654
00:55:27,260 --> 00:55:32,260
And, you know, and I know it's maybe not the specific words we're talking about with language.

655
00:55:32,260 --> 00:55:36,260
But just kind of the whole philosophy of how much do you tell.

656
00:55:36,260 --> 00:55:39,260
And, you know, it's different for different people.

657
00:55:39,260 --> 00:55:42,260
But I would say to you this.

658
00:55:42,260 --> 00:55:50,260
I think the, one of the bigger challenges I encounter with consults is people who will say, I, just like Joanna said.

659
00:55:50,260 --> 00:55:51,260
Yes.

660
00:55:51,260 --> 00:55:58,260
