671
00:57:00,260 --> 00:57:04,260
I need to tell her that because she needs closure.

672
00:57:04,260 --> 00:57:12,260
And my response to that is often so you're thinking she needs closure.

673
00:57:12,260 --> 00:57:17,260
I'm wondering who else might need closure.

674
00:57:17,260 --> 00:57:19,260
I mean, whose closure are we talking about here?

675
00:57:19,260 --> 00:57:29,260
Because oftentimes that is, that is what's going on, is the care partner is the one that needs the closure.

676
00:57:29,260 --> 00:57:33,260
The person living with dementia, they've had the closure.

677
